# reference-manifest.baseline — known-dangling manifest refs, sorted `<from>::<path>`.
#
# REMOVAL-ONLY ratchet: ci-lints.sh (section `manifest`) fails on an unbaselined
# dangling ref AND on an entry whose ref resolves again, so an entry can never be
# swapped for a fresh violation. Every entry names the work that retires it.
#
# Only a ref whose fix is owned by a NAMED later work package belongs here. A
# ref that is fixable inside wp-02's boundaries is fixed at source; a path that
# deliberately addresses something outside the plugin tree belongs on
# reference-ignore.txt instead.

# retired-by: wp-03-packaging-homes — packages/goalforge/commands/*.md move into
# the generated tree there; today only commands/wayfind.md is PRESERVE'd in.
skills/run/SKILL.md::commands/spec.md
